{"id":85576158646206,"name":"Steal A Brainrot","desc":"🗣️ Welcome to Steal a Brainrot!\n\n\n👍 Like the game and join the group \n🌀 Next Brainrot God at: 10M LIKES!\n\nHow to Play:\n👽 Buy a Brainrot \n🥷 Steal Brainrot from other players \n💸 Generate money \n🐦‍🔥 Rebirth \n✋ Buy slaps and troll gear to troll other players! \n\n💻 Supports Desktop, Mobile and Tablet players \n\n🙏 Credit to Chris for letting us use the Nyan Cat! \n🙏 Credit to @WinnersTakesAll for the backpack system! \nGame inspired by NotJandel STEAL A BRAINROT \"MODDED\"\nThis game is inspired by NotJandel's STEAL A BRAINROT, a game that has been modified to include new features and improvements. The objective of this game is to steal a brainrot from a target, which is a type of brain damage that can cause memory loss, cognitive impairment, and other neurological problems.\nThe game features a first-person perspective, where the player controls a character who attempts to steal a brainrot from a target. The target can be a human or an animal, and the brainrot can be stolen from their brain. The player must use various techniques to steal the brainrot, such as using drugs or electrical stimulation.\nThe game also includes a multiplayer mode, where players can compete against each other in real-time. This mode allows players to steal brainrot from each other, creating a more intense and competitive experience. Additionally, the game includes a tutorial mode, which helps players learn how to play the game and understand its mechanics.\nOverall, this game is designed to provide an immersive and challenging experience, where players must use their skills and knowledge to overcome various obstacles and achieve their goals.","path":"/game/85576158646206-steal-a-brainrot","slug":"85576158646206-steal-a-brainrot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c09416304f0f9a866e2113251cc5c162eef7f3dbe11181eea8fb78640b2f9f6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b52326c4e777b09f4cc221ca00f4ac9d/150/150/Image